| Pb₂WO₅, C2/m prototype | 15.75% |
| WO₃, P2₁/n | 10.34% |
| PbO massicot, Pbcm | 7.13% |
| PbO litharge, P4/nmm | 5.21% |

Final fit: Rwp 11.688%, Rp 7.893%, GOF 3.345. Project reload and all 8,282 profile rows passed consistency checks.

